{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "We Bowling?!",
    "steam_appid": 3564260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564260/extras/496a35f49531d553fc7cd8ce0dfee59d.avif?t=1745879095\" data-has-big width=800 height=409 /></span><strong>&quot;We Bowling?!&quot;</strong> is what happens when a bowling ball escapes the alley and goes on a wild adventure! Roll, bounce, and yeet your way through obstacle courses packed with ramps, seesaws, moving platforms, and even minigolf-style chaos. The pins are waiting at the end, but can you get there fast enough to top the leaderboards? Speed, precision, and a little bit of luck will decide if you\u2019re a strike or a total gutterball. So, We Bowling!? Or are you gonna split?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564260/extras/496a35f49531d553fc7cd8ce0dfee59d.avif?t=1745879095\" data-has-big width=800 height=409 /></span><strong>&quot;We Bowling?!&quot;</strong> is what happens when a bowling ball escapes the alley and goes on a wild adventure! Roll, bounce, and yeet your way through obstacle courses packed with ramps, seesaws, moving platforms, and even minigolf-style chaos. The pins are waiting at the end, but can you get there fast enough to top the leaderboards? Speed, precision, and a little bit of luck will decide if you\u2019re a strike or a total gutterball. So, We Bowling!? Or are you gonna split?</p>",
    "short_description": "WeBowling?! is built from the ground up for Speedrunners. In this game you take control of a bowling ball of your choosing and make your way through the obstacles as fast as you can! With 10 current tracks and global steam leaderboards, there are plenty of opportunities for you to get that WR!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
